      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PANADERO DIVA (3) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including two wins and four placings. Scored by 6 lengths last time (27.33) in a Grade 4/5 over 488m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. CORTINA ACKEE (2) goes very well this trip starting 13 times for five wins and two minors. Comes off a (22.39) win last time, scoring by 4.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Looks well placed here and among the chances. HE'S A HOOLIGAN (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 5 lengths away in third (22.93) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Expected to be in the finish again. FOXY SIN (8) has to be respected despite coming off a three-and-a-half months break.",
